{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102410","id":2315221635,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6J_3qD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102410","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102410.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102410.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102410","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102410/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102410/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102410/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c8342122022e859199c96ea684462181b88f4a72","number":102410,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement post-processing levels for VideoStreamPlayer and Theora","user":{"login":"berarma","id":162766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Mjc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma","html_url":"https://github.com/berarma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berarma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is based on #102360 and #101958. I could have based this on master but I prefer to keep the order of the PRs. Otherwise, it would break my other PRs and it wouldn't be very useful by itself anyway. Each PR has its own commit with the commit message matching the PR title to avoid confusion.\r\n\r\nThis is part of a  request for comments in godotengine/godot-proposals#11699 that I'm opening for this feature.\r\n\r\nI'm adding a `pp_level` property to VideoStreamPlayer so that we can set a maximum preferred post-processing level from 0 (disabled) to 255 (max). The real max value used will depend on the codec implementation. Since the requested value is a maximum, the codec will be able to choose.\r\n\r\nI've also enabled post-processing in VideoStreamTheora. VideoStreamTheora will dinamically change the pp level depending on how much time is spent decoding frames between 0 and `pp_level`.\r\n\r\nThis property should be useful for other codecs added as plugins.","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undeter